			                WORK ORDER LIST
			            </div>
			            <div style='font-size: 22px; font-weight: 700; display: flex; align-items: center; gap: 10px;'>
			                <span style='color: #10b981;'>🔧</span>
			                <span>" & SelectedJobCode & "</span>
			            </div>
